on. Right state, right month; spoken word was consolation.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2020_22_09','review_doc_2020_22_09','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Miss on “storm,” then rewritten. Place and month only.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2020_22_10','review_doc_2020_22_10','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Moderate. Best early-2021 clock. Predictability still caps it.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2020_22_11','review_doc_2020_22_11','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2020_22_12','review_doc_2020_22_12','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2020_22_13','review_doc_2020_22_13','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Moderate as season-and-country. Weak as unique Dec 2021 revelation. Strongest 2021 row so far.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2020_22_14','review_doc_2020_22_14','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2020_22_15','review_doc_2020_22_15','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2020_22_16','review_doc_2020_22_16','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2020_22_17','review_doc_2020_22_17','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak to moderate. Right office; almost maximally predictable.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2020_22_18','review_doc_2020_22_18','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak. Loud January, wrong 1990 country, public story.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2020_22_19','review_doc_2020_22_19','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak to moderate timing. Weak uniqueness.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2020_22_20','review_doc_2020_22_20','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak as a 2022 hit. The 2023 sequel is the one that sits near the event.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2020_22_21','review_doc_2020_22_21','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2020_22_22','review_doc_2020_22_22','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Moderate as a sector call.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2020_22_23','review_doc_2020_22_23','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak to moderate.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00