','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Keyword only.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2023_03','review_doc_2023_03','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Atmospherics.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2023_04','review_doc_2023_04','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak / mixed.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2023_05','review_doc_2023_05','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Partial – keep on the short list. Not a named, detailed hit.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2023_06','review_doc_2023_06','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Retrofit.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2023_07','review_doc_2023_07','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Non-prophecy.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2023_08','review_doc_2023_08','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2023_09','review_doc_2023_09','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Fail.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2023_10','review_doc_2023_10','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Partial image, failed as a timed prediction.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2023_11','review_doc_2023_11','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Partial. Do not over-credit as “Israel war prophesied in detail.”','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2023_12','review_doc_2023_12','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Fail. Confirmation-by-meme.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2023_13','review_doc_2023_13','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak class hit.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2023_14','review_doc_2023_14','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Keyword / visual miss. Not prophesied in detail.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2023_15','review_doc_2023_15','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Correct partisan forecast. Do not file as supernatural knowledge.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2023_16','review_doc_2023_16','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Fail as stated.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2023_17','review_doc_2023_17','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Notable partial. Best 2023 candidate after Luna-25. Still unnamed. Not proof of office.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2023_18','review_doc_2023_18','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Fail. Clearest “already happened, then relabeled” entry of the year.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z')) WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO doc_review_attestations (attestation_id,review_id,doc_ref,doc_title,verbatim_verdict,rubric_version,verified_by,verified_at,created_at)
SELECT * FROM (VALUES ('docattest_2023_19','review_doc_2023_19','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Tragic real event; low prophetic difficulty. Weak as a test of hearing.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2023_20','review_doc_2023_20','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Fail as prediction.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_01','review_doc_2024_01','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak match. This appears to be a retrofitted interpretation of routine California weather impacting agriculture rather than a clear, specific prophecy. The symbolic vision doesn''t naturally point to flooding emergencies. 2.​ Previously reviewed in another document','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_03','review_doc_2024_03','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This one lands as a correct prediction, but the human predictability factor is high. It doesn''t require supernatural insight to foresee a struggling candidate running out of money and support.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_04','review_doc_2024_04','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This is a weak example. While the timing and general location are impressive, the actual event doesn''t match the dramatic vision described. The fulfillment relies heavily on retrofitting a minor earthquake to a much more intense-sounding prophecy. It follows a common pattern in the archive: vague enough to claim hits, but lacking the precision and scale that would make it compelling.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_05','review_doc_2024_05','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Partial overlap with public events. Retrofitted. Not a clean or impressive fulfillment. The archive presents it as a hit, but the details show a vague remark on a known story that was later reshaped to fit the outcome.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_06','review_doc_2024_06','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This is a classic example of vague language being retrofitted to a political event after it happened. The original word was too general to be meaningful, and the specific connection to January 6 was not in the video. It doesn’t hold up as a genuine prophetic word.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_07','review_doc_2024_07','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This is a weak, vague “prophecy” that only works because wrestling legends eventually pass away — or retire, or finish a match. Predicting that a famous old wrestler will be “through” someday isn’t impressive. The 16-month gap and lack of any specific detail make this one of the least convincing entries in the archive.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_08','review_doc_2024_08','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This one’s better than the wrestling legend because it had a tighter timeline and tied into a very public, ongoing story. Still, predicting more trouble at a ministry already embroiled in scandal isn’t exactly bold prophecy. The Reese Witherspoon vision feels like a weird add-on they’re trying to make fit.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_09','review_doc_2024_09','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This is classic “prophesying the news.” Everyone following politics in March 2024 knew Trump’s cases were moving through the courts. Calling ongoing legal drama “election interference” in a 10-day window isn’t impressive — it was inevitable. One of the weaker political entries.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_10','review_doc_2024_10','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This one’s a stretch. The Arctic connection is there, but the actual vision of new islands and a cosmic event doesn’t line up with a paper about a glacier causing weird seismic waves the year before. It feels like they grabbed the word “Arctic” and ran with it.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_11','review_doc_2024_11','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This one falls apart on closer look. The prophecy hinged on both events happening at the same time as a dramatic sign. Two and a half weeks apart with no connection between them makes this a clear miss, not a fulfillment. The archive is really reaching on this one.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_12','review_doc_2024_12','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This one’s quite weak. The “in the spirit” line makes it clear he was talking about a spiritual shift in the church, not a literal dam breaking. Claiming a Russian embankment failure fulfills it is a major stretch, especially since it wasn’t even a proper dam. The archive significantly changed the meaning of the original word.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_13','review_doc_2024_13','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This one’s quite weak. The Rosie vision is awkwardly tied to an unrelated honoring of elderly women, and linking it to Harris losing months later feels like reaching. It’s mostly political commentary presented as prophecy.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_14','review_doc_2024_14','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This is mostly political speculation presented as prophecy. The “puppet master” language came from Biden’s camp months later, not from Troy’s original word. It’s a weak connection.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_15','review_doc_2024_15','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This one doesn’t hold up. The prophecy described a near-disaster in Italy that gets averted, with specific spiritual imagery tied to Rome and the Vatican. Protests over a G7 meeting are routine and don’t match any of the key details. This appears to be a clear miss that the archive is trying to salvage.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_16','review_doc_2024_16','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This is a classic vague “promotion” word that could apply to many things. Applying it to Rubio’s Secretary of State role is a stretch, especially with all the baseball metaphors that don’t connect to the actual event. It’s not a strong hit.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_17','review_doc_2024_17','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This is a classic example of vague prophetic language that’s impossible to disprove. “Nations shaking” in summer is something you could apply to almost any major news story. Without a specific claimed fulfillment, it doesn’t really function as a testable prophecy.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_18','review_doc_2024_18','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This does not qualify as a genuine predictive prophecy. The original word was too vague to be','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_19','review_doc_2024_19','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This one doesn''t hold up. The Trump assassination connection was never in the original','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_20','review_doc_2024_20','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Doesn''t hold up as a clear prophecy. The original word was broad symbolic imagery that can be','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_22','review_doc_2024_22','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This is one of his stronger ones timing-wise, but still falls into the category of general political','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_23','review_doc_2024_23','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This is a weak example. The prophecy is vague, the timeline is off, and the fulfillment feels forced to fit a pre-existing news story. It doesn’t hold up well under close examination. Want me to dig into another one?','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_24','review_doc_2024_24','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This is a classic example of a vague prophecy being applied to a major headline after it happens. The one-month timing is the strongest element, but the lack of specific details about Trump or an assassination attempt makes the connection feel forced. It''s not one of his stronger claims.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_25','review_doc_2024_25','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This is another weak claim. The prophecy is overly vague and cryptic, and the "fulfillment" feels like a post-hoc connection to a predictable and already-discussed event. The timing is close, but the lack of real specificity hurts its credibility.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z')) WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO doc_review_attestations (attestation_id,review_id,doc_ref,doc_title,verbatim_verdict,rubric_version,verified_by,verified_at,created_at)
SELECT * FROM (VALUES ('docattest_2024_26','review_doc_2024_26','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This is another weak claim. The prophecy is broad, uses a lot of qualifiers, and the fulfillment requires connecting distant dots. The second attempt timing and details don''t line up cleanly, and the Kamala Harris section feels especially forced.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_27','review_doc_2024_27','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This one stands out because it doesn’t even have a claimed fulfillment. It’s very generic advice that could apply to almost any investor. Without a specific event tied to it, it doesn’t function as a testable prophecy.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_28','review_doc_2024_28','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This is a weak claim. The prophecy is vague, the timing is off by a couple days, and the event was not particularly violent or unusual. It feels like normal protest activity being tied to a broad word after the fact.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_29','review_doc_2024_29','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This is a weak claim. The prophecy is mostly a spiritual metaphor about the church, with Star Wars used symbolically. Tying it to a predictable celebrity death and a struggling show’s cancellation feels forced.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_30','review_doc_2024_30','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This is one of Troy’s stronger claims. The prophecy was specific, named the person, and the event happened shortly after. However, the very public nature of the feud significantly weakens its prophetic weight — many people saw this coming.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_31','review_doc_2024_31','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Troy Black Prophecy Evaluation: Hurricane Surprise (August 19, 2024) This is a weak claim. Predicting a surprising hurricane during hurricane season is extremely low-specificity. Almost any major storm could be made to fit. The timing gap between the prophecy and the storm further weakens it.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_32','review_doc_2024_32','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This is another weak claim. The prophecy uses very generic political language that could describe almost any failed campaign. There’s nothing specific enough to make this a strong prophetic word.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_33','review_doc_2024_33','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This is a weak claim. Giving a two-week timeline should make it more testable, but tying a scheduled VP debate to a prophecy about Kamala Harris feels like a stretch. The fulfillment doesn’t hold up well.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_34','review_doc_2024_34','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This is one of his better matches because of the unusual “setting fire to themselves” line. However, the second paragraph of his fulfillment claim — where he says it would spark a national conversation about healthy responses and speak to the church — is completely unsupported. That discussion never happened. So while the core image partially matched, the broader meaning he attached to it was added after the fact. Still a stretch overall.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_35','review_doc_2024_35','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This is one of the weakest ones we’ve looked at. Saying “three important dates” during an active war is not a real prophecy — it’s too vague to fail. He simply chose three newsworthy days afterward.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_36','review_doc_2024_36','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This one is very weak. The original word is full of metaphors that only make sense after the fact, and the connections feel heavily retrofitted. The Waldorf and Godfather imagery only ties in through a later dream, not the prophecy itself. Classic example of vague symbolism being applied to a scandal after it breaks.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_37','review_doc_2024_37','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This is a weak claim. The prophecy is vague enough to attach to any new dinosaur fossil study, and collagen in fossils was already a known controversy long before October 2024. The claimed fulfillment doesn’t match the scale or impact described in the original word.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_38','review_doc_2024_38','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This is a very weak claim. Predicting that Trump would resume border wall construction after winning the election is not prophetic — it’s simply repeating what Trump had publicly promised for years. The timing right before the election makes it even less impressive.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_39','review_doc_2024_39','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Overall Assessment (no separate verdict): This prophecy is unfalsifiable. “Witches will be disappointed their spells don’t work” can be claimed as true no matter what happens — if Trump wins, if he loses, or if nothing changes. The fulfillment relies on a few Reddit posts that conveniently appeared right after he posted the video. It’s more of a faith-based encouragement than a testable prediction.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_40','review_doc_2024_40','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','This is a weak claim. The prophecy is highly symbolic and broad, given right after a major election when political tensions were high. Connecting scattered violent incidents months later as a "political bomb war" feels like retrofitting. The metaphorical language gives him too much wiggle room.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_41','review_doc_2024_41','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak. While her initial appointment matched the “more influential than people realize” part, the prophecy explicitly said she would be much more influential “over the course of the next four years.” She only served about 15 months before resigning in June 2026. The core timeframe given in the prophecy did not hold, which significantly weakens the claim.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_42','review_doc_2024_42','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak. Laser weapons for countering drones were already a known, actively developing technology in 2024. Predicting they would appear in the news soon was not a bold or specific prophecy. The dramatic vision of slicing an airplane in half also doesn’t match the actual use against small drones.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_43','review_doc_2024_43','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Very weak. Predicting that Disney World would have technical problems during Christmas is like predicting it’ll be crowded — it happens every year. There’s nothing here that rises above normal operational issues.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_44','review_doc_2024_44','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Moderate. The July 2025 timing and the very large 8.8 earthquake give this one more weight than most of his prophecies. However, the political fulfillment feels forced, and the wording is loose enough to attach to almost any major July news. It’s one of his better ones, but still not airtight.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_45','review_doc_2024_45','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Very weak. Predicting fights at football games is like predicting car accidents during rush hour — it happens regularly. There was nothing unusual or prophetic about this.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_46','review_doc_2024_46','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Very weak. This prophecy is so vague that it can never really be wrong. China has been posturing around Taiwan for years. Saying “they want war but won’t get it on their terms” is not a risky or specific prediction. It’s mostly political commentary presented as prophecy.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_47','review_doc_2024_47','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Very weak. Predicting that Biden would issue controversial pardons at Christmas is not prophetic. This is something political observers expected to happen. Outgoing presidents have done this for decades.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_48','review_doc_2024_48','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak. While the timing was close and the fire was destructive, the prophecy incorrectly pointed to a Midwestern state, and major California wildfires are a recurring annual event. The fulfillment requires overlooking the location mismatch.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2024_49','review_doc_2024_49','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak to moderate. The same-day Treasury hack timing looks impressive at first glance, but the original prophecy was about financial systems going haywire and U.S. leaders looking to China for debt relief — not a cyber breach. The trade war connection feels even more forced. The vagueness allows him to claim multiple unrelated events as fulfillment.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2025_01','review_doc_2025_01','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak to moderate on timing and topic. Weak as a fulfilled prediction. February + U.S./U.K. + Trump-vs-media is the best part of the word, and those themes did show up. That is not surprising eleven days before a Trump inauguration. The archive then stitches several separate February stories onto metaphors that were never specified in advance. Scale, unique details, and the “war / warriors / march / ruckus ends” lines do not hold. Not a miss so complete that the month was empty. Not a hit specific enough to count as strong evidence of supernatural foresight.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z')) WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO doc_review_attestations (attestation_id,review_id,doc_ref,doc_title,verbatim_verdict,rubric_version,verified_by,verified_at,created_at)
SELECT * FROM (VALUES ('docattest_2025_02','review_doc_2025_02','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak to moderate regional resonance. Weak as a single fulfilled word. Long window + split storylines.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2025_03','review_doc_2025_03','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak. Correct category (tech combination + announcement). Wrong implied structure (two separate firms + outside political pressure). Highly predictable inside Musk’s own stack.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2025_04','review_doc_2025_04','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak. Named brand plus a pre-existing story that later got louder. Not a clean hit.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2025_05','review_doc_2025_05','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Moderate timing, weak uniqueness. One of the tighter short windows in the early-2025 set, but it rides a fully public purge.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2025_06','review_doc_2025_06','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Moderate on the tower/quake image and quarter. Weak on the casino vision and on double-counting the same quake under Malaysia. Stronger than average visually; still not tight geography.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2025_07','review_doc_2025_07','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak to moderate. Date + topic lined up with actions that coalition already wanted.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2025_08','review_doc_2025_08','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Moderate only if scored as “Trump-plot news drops within a week.” Weak if scored as predicting a new attempt. Pre-existing custody is the hole in the archive write-up.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2025_09','review_doc_2025_09','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak. Broad net over a long-running debate.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2025_10','review_doc_2025_10','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak. Unfalsifiable revival language plus a short calendar.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2025_11','review_doc_2025_11','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Moderate. Best country-and-timing match in this block. Predictability still caps it.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2025_12','review_doc_2025_12','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak as prediction. Ordinary warning plus a much later news cycle.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2025_13','review_doc_2025_13','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026','Weak. Too short to test; fulfillment is a semantic reversal.','doc-rubric-v1','site_owner','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('docattest_2025_14','review_doc_2025_14','joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09','Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026',