-california-farming-problems',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"false","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_01_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"false\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_01_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"Weak match. This appears to be a retrofitted interpretation of routine California weather impacting agriculture rather than a clear, specific prophecy. The symbolic vision doesn''t naturally point to flooding emergencies. 2.​ Previously reviewed in another document"}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_3b8939fc850335e06980d4149a3a9ed7315e999c60cbacf293d400b4fcb623f5','tb-2024-03-nikki-haley-s-loss',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"false","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_03_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"false\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_03_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"This one lands as a correct prediction, but the human predictability factor is high. It doesn''t require supernatural insight to foresee a struggling candidate running out of money and support."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_5f626288a56f884abc598c2ecc2007ec9a309178bcb46a09e9d0a3fc6eef8a2e','tb-2024-04-oklahoma-earthquake-from-january-31st-2024',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"false","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_04_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"false\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_04_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"This is a weak example. While the timing and general location are impressive, the actual event doesn''t match the dramatic vision described. The fulfillment relies heavily on retrofitting a minor earthquake to a much more intense-sounding prophecy. It follows a common pattern in the archive: vague enough to claim hits, but lacking the precision and scale that would make it compelling."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_ad29e6d9543ce9536897ec0995cf55721bb219af68daefe8d3fd7a01b5116bd4','tb-2024-05-trump-stock',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"partial","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_05_arch","evidence_tb_2024_05_foll0","evidence_tb_2024_05_orig"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"partial\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_05_arch\",\"evidence_tb_2024_05_foll0\",\"evidence_tb_2024_05_orig\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"Partial overlap with public events. Retrofitted. Not a clean or impressive fulfillment. The archive presents it as a hit, but the details show a vague remark on a known story that was later reshaped to fit the outcome."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_de3a86c6775641331787412e5f5f89e7227a57459d6b3d32a5b50fca21227871','tb-2024-06-5-day-reversal-january-6th-lies',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"false","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_06_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"false\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_06_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"This is a classic example of vague language being retrofitted to a political event after it happened. The original word was too general to be meaningful, and the specific connection to January 6 was not in the video. It doesn’t hold up as a genuine prophetic word."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_29dc139c0fa9c9828a806d1d81dcdde47fc8fae699d52d817c372481da19695f','tb-2024-07-the-death-of-a-wrestling-legend',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"false","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_07_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"false\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_07_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"This is a weak, vague “prophecy” that only works because wrestling legends eventually pass away — or retire, or finish a match. Predicting that a famous old wrestler will be “through” someday isn’t impressive. The 16-month gap and lack of any specific detail make this one of the least convincing entries in the archive."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_976c016cadd1432b19617b1d8e66515dcddbee14232631f6ccc55ff39964c623','tb-2024-08-ihopkc-closing-and-cover-up',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"false","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_08_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"false\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_08_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"This one’s better than the wrestling legend because it had a tighter timeline and tied into a very public, ongoing story. Still, predicting more trouble at a ministry already embroiled in scandal isn’t exactly bold prophecy. The Reese Witherspoon vision feels like a weird add-on they’re trying to make fit."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_148a71f076c17c2a90a7c44bb9e8440f68b09c1befd67eda043303080b606d14','tb-2024-09-10-day-prophecy-election-interference',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"false","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_09_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"false\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_09_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"This is classic “prophesying the news.” Everyone following politics in March 2024 knew Trump’s cases were moving through the courts. Calling ongoing legal drama “election interference” in a 10-day window isn’t impressive — it was inevitable. One of the weaker political entries."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_06b5fa22e6add9a63bd6a95c8c89259c19e842393bfd109e9a6a6ef9a2feb87a','tb-2024-10-arctic-circle-discovery',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"false","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_10_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"false\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_10_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"This one’s a stretch. The Arctic connection is there, but the actual vision of new islands and a cosmic event doesn’t line up with a paper about a glacier causing weird seismic waves the year before. It feels like they grabbed the word “Arctic” and ran with it."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_47f5e90fce42475a649e7050076d76c8e6f3ee5265443d2125286f286c85527a','tb-2024-11-closing-chocolate-factory-and-taiwan-earthquake',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"false","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_11_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"false\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_11_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"This one falls apart on closer look. The prophecy hinged on both events happening at the same time as a dramatic sign. Two and a half weeks apart with no connection between them makes this a clear miss, not a fulfillment. The archive is really reaching on this one."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_e82e06e51f6dc24a5bae52f1f95affaa3fef9feb30f456f8fb20425749aed820','tb-2024-12-dam-breaks-corruption-exposed-two-week',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","