It’s mostly political commentary presented as prophecy."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_5459c022ba83622fb496be56cc725e9fa6a0d9e991c5b5709908b192396f4c90','tb-2024-14-obama-the-puppet-master-and-biden',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"false","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_14_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"false\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_14_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"This is mostly political speculation presented as prophecy. The “puppet master” language came from Biden’s camp months later, not from Troy’s original word. It’s a weak connection."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_a7dfb6ce09bc9ea5b1d12674472d21968af4e6ef8d87df5a95602b3efbc07d15','tb-2024-15-italy-s-ten-day-prophecy',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"false","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_15_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"false\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_15_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVe