ence_tb_2024_31_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"false\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_31_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"Troy Black Prophecy Evaluation: Hurricane Surprise (August 19, 2024) This is a weak claim. Predicting a surprising hurricane during hurricane season is extremely low-specificity. Almost any major storm could be made to fit. The timing gap between the prophecy and the storm further weakens it."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_c539654092e3a6cac24414f433dbebd3b2c92cbc3d8261bdd28ed59b5d18c5ca','tb-2024-32-kamala-harris-backfire-and-political-body',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"false","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_32_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"false\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_32_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"This is another weak claim. The prophecy uses very generic political language that could describe almost any failed campaign. There’s nothing specific enough to make this a strong prophetic word."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_bb26e9071a6b1b39d5a409df85d1f389adc9e7ab406380b9c1e52e12d59bb4bc','tb-2024-33-kamala-harris-two-weeks-september-9',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"false","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_33_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"false\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_33_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"This is a weak claim. Giving a two-week timeline should make it more testable, but tying a scheduled VP debate to a prophecy about Kamala Harris feels like a stretch. The fulfillment doesn’t hold up well."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_de94af3e60fe5b408bdf44b8c1a7b4719dc41e624a63ede1c72f7b60875916a2','tb-2024-34-rioter-setting-fire-to-himself-september',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"partial","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_34_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"partial\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_34_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"This is one of his better matches because of the unusual “setting fire to themselves” line. However, the second paragraph of his fulfillment claim — where he says it would spark a national conversation about healthy responses and speak to the church — is completely unsupported. That discussion never happened. So while the core image partially matched, the broader meaning he attached to it was added after the fact. Still a stretch overall."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_377ba9ecc761794ade1d6eecd060fdcb58b8388324addaa32f230370862f6665','tb-2024-35-three-important-dates-israel-s-conflicts',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"false","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_35_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"false\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_35_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"This is one of the weakest ones we’ve looked at. Saying “three important dates” during an active war is not a real prophecy — it’s too vague to fail. He simply chose three newsworthy days afterward."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_658b582f3cb5497b3b79d09b4327580f0d84eba24ab00c94a5ddfe58d7eaf0f0','tb-2024-36-daystar-drama-september-27-2024',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"false","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_36_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"false\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_36_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"This one is very weak. The original word is full of metaphors that only make sense after the fact, and the connections feel heavily retrofitted. The Waldorf and Godfather imagery only ties in through a later dream, not the prophecy itself. Classic example of vague symbolism being applied to a scandal after it breaks."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_2387c32b7881692328c7ed746591257f71c1aa309da3d2294f58552ac167c001','tb-2024-37-major-dinosaur-fossil-discovery-october-4',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"false","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_37_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"false\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_37_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"This is a weak claim. The prophecy is vague enough to attach to any new dinosaur fossil study, and collagen in fossils was already a known controversy long before October 2024. The claimed fulfillment doesn’t match the scale or impact described in the original word."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_a7bf01525c38b7153723debc00e490a4f4a9906bdb5c8859dd3a5e0174e0671c','tb-2024-38-border-wall-construction-october-16-2024',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"false","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_38_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"false\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_38_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"This is a very weak claim. Predicting that Trump would resume border wall construction after winning the election is not prophetic — it’s simply repeating what Trump had publicly promised for years. The timing right before the election makes it even less impressive."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_1a9f16cd3cc380816f8a898381e53ddcbf7027a04284aaf59a66aabdcaf4df08','tb-2024-39-witches-can-t-curse-trump-october',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"not_falsifiable","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_39_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"not_falsifiable\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_39_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"Overall Assessment (no separate verdict): This prophecy is unfalsifiable. “Witches will be disappointed their spells don’t work” can be claimed as true no matter what happens — if Trump wins, if he loses, or if nothing changes. The fulfillment relies on a few Reddit posts that conveniently appeared right after he posted the video. It’s more of a faith-based encouragement than a testable prediction."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_1c7b80e81cbc19d0c6b04fe22a1feb755d9af0fcdd2ab33b3f5252bdf3113a9c','tb-2024-40-political-bomb-war-november-16-2024',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"false","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_40_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"false\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_40_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"This is a weak claim. The prophecy is highly symbolic and broad, given right after a major election when political tensions were high. Connecting scattered violent incidents months later as a \"political bomb war\" feels like retrofitting. The metaphorical language gives him too much wiggle room."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_7b1e00eb1b1c67dabbbb4e35343689a61f66e6c5683883c2cd487c5fcb98aa0d','tb-2024-41-tulsi-gabbard-november-20-2024',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"false","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_41_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"false\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_41_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"Weak. While her initial appointment matched the “more influential than people realize” part, the prophecy explicitly said she would be much more influential “over the course of the next four years.” She only served about 15 months before resigning in June 2026. The core timeframe given in the prophecy did not hold, which significantly weakens the claim."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_778f30d1a65ca857f07b885c56ca6a3298e1f0645ea63802e1eccc1ad86a1070','tb-2024-42-laser-weapon-technology-november-11th-2024',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"false","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_42_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"false\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_42_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"Weak. Laser weapons for countering drones were already a known, actively developing technology in 2024. Predicting they would appear in the news soon was not a bold or specific prophecy. The dramatic vision of slicing an airplane in half also doesn’t match the actual use against small drones."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_b39614faa2b91943e552639ac1cdcdcb87b7d50955081d9cae92d39646b0050b','tb-2024-43-disney-christmas-2024-november-25-2024',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"false","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_43_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"false\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_43_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"Very weak. Predicting that Disney World would have technical problems during Christmas is like predicting it’ll be crowded — it happens every year. There’s nothing here that rises above normal operational issues."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_80d0236c662a46b1b1f4a4dd759b6e5d6252005029a9bd44e8cddf0338d14a66','tb-2024-44-both-real-and-political-earthquakes-november',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"partial","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_44_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"partial\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_44_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"Moderate. The July 2025 timing and the very large 8.8 earthquake give this one more weight than most of his prophecies. However, the political fulfillment feels forced, and the wording is loose enough to attach to almost any major July news. It’s one of his better ones, but still not airtight."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_bfa2e87e897793aa901d0da9b42a92ecb57273d7ea2059ac9c607a1b98949838','tb-2024-45-football-field-brawls-november-28-2024',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"false","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_45_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"false\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_45_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"Very weak. Predicting fights at football games is like predicting car accidents during rush hour — it happens regularly. There was nothing unusual or prophetic about this."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_0dcbcfff28af0c0e12a9110dd3ee395925c8cd42bb508baed035b9a1ca6a412c','tb-2024-46-china-wants-war-december-4-2024',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"false","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_46_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"false\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_46_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"Very weak. This prophecy is so vague that it can never really be wrong. China has been posturing around Taiwan for years. Saying “they want war but won’t get it on their terms” is not a risky or specific prediction. It’s mostly political commentary presented as prophecy."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_17d90c0c76edc076f6ac57aec143e766ff2ff2c39e70cbbfbbbd23f790c14851','tb-2024-47-biden-s-christmas-commutations-december-11',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"false","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_47_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"false\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_47_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"Very weak. Predicting that Biden would issue controversial pardons at Christmas is not prophetic. This is something political observers expected to happen. Outgoing presidents have done this for decades."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_be3bb1cc631517852432224a898dee24f17629ddc9b776afea086bcb15ac1aca','tb-2024-48-la-fires-prophesied-2025-december-28',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"false","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_48_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"false\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_48_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"Weak. While the timing was close and the fire was destructive, the prophecy incorrectly pointed to a Midwestern state, and major California wildfires are a recurring annual event. The fulfillment requires overlooking the location mismatch."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_12c320593f7a8f8e89e1ce4dbda387ccf5c431ad2890536cd25e2ef92e889e0a','tb-2024-49-china-hacks-u-s-treasury-and',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"partial","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2024_49_arch"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"partial\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2024_49_arch\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"Weak to moderate. The same-day Treasury hack timing looks impressive at first glance, but the original prophecy was about financial systems going haywire and U.S. leaders looking to China for debt relief — not a cyber breach. The trade war connection feels even more forced. The vagueness allows him to claim multiple unrelated events as fulfillment."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),('revision_publication_eacb4cb61c698b592f414a106e89e6c12ee2478a394283007a4b6d3af9f8b60f','tb-2025-01-u-k-and-u-s-february',1,'publication','{"lane":"doc_review","claimType":"testable_prediction","outcomeStatus":"partial","noveltyStatus":"not_assessed","baselineProbability":null,"evidenceIds":["evidence_tb_2025_01_arch","evidence_tb_2025_01_orig"],"priorReceiptId":null,"reviewerNames":["Joshua"],"decisionFingerprint":"{\"claimType\":\"testable_prediction\",\"outcomeStatus\":\"partial\",\"noveltyStatus\":\"not_assessed\",\"baselineProbability\":null,\"evidenceIds\":[\"evidence_tb_2025_01_arch\",\"evidence_tb_2025_01_orig\"],\"priorReceiptId\":null}","docRef":"joshua-harris-troy-black-review-2026-09","docTitle":"Troy Black Prophecy Archive Review 2020–2026","rubricVersion":"doc-rubric-v1","verbatimVerdict":"Weak to moderate on timing and topic. Weak as a fulfilled prediction. February + U.S./U.K. + Trump-vs-media is the best part of the word, and those themes did show up. That is not surprising eleven days before a Trump inauguration. The archive then stitches several separate February stories onto metaphors that were never specified in advance. Scale, unique details, and the “war / warriors / march / ruckus ends” lines do not hold. Not a miss so complete that the month was empty. Not a hit specific enough to count as strong evidence of supernatural foresight."}','["' || (SELECT reviewer_id FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua' LIMIT 1) || '"]','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z')) WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM reviewer_public_attributions WHERE display_name='Joshua');
